'''Cotton Candy''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by earning 10 million coins in-game and purchasing the [https://www.roblox.com/badges/435788016/Cotton-Candy-Knife-Discontinued Cotton Candy badge] from the experience [[Space Tycoon]], which would then allow you to claim the knife in Murder Mystery 2. It is now only obtainable through trading as the promotional event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade resembles the texture of cotton candy with one half being pink and the other blue, hence the name. The guard is light blue, and the handle is a darker blue.   

== Trivia ==
*This knife is thought to be only available from June 2016 to September 2016, due to the badge being updated in September and [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=11kBQm1ARUs Youtube tutorials] being made in June.
*Only 14,927 people were able to obtain this badge unlike the 88,602 people that were able to obtain the [https://www.roblox.com/badges/476157860/Asteroid-Gun-Discontinued Asteroid Gun badge], which allowed the player to obtain the [[Asteroid]] gun.
*It partners and is commonly paired with the common gun [[Asteroid]]. However, they're not considered a set.
*Unlike other collectibles, this knife was not heavily targeted in duping. It was decently targeted in [[The Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*The game where you would obtain this item was the same game where you could’ve obtained the [[Asteroid]] gun.
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/Cotton-Candy-item?id=435933179 here].

